            "heading": "",
            "text": "Bioinformatics vs biotechnology is a choice between computer-led analysis of biological data and lab-led experimental work, and the better fit depends on whether you prefer coding and statistics or hands-on experiments, with many roles blending both."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Try one small coding task on public biological data and one lab-style exercise and notice which you enjoy and do well."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Verify course content and avoid programmes promising guaranteed placements."
